    "long_instructions": "**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Implement the final normalization rule: removing stop words.\r\n- Test your program. It should count four unique entries.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nOne way to approach this task is to build a list of word tokens that are not stop words. Recall that you can use `not in` to check whether a value is not part of some list.",
